<title>USA: Hughes Electronics wins Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes Electronics wins Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Neb. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Aircraft Co, a unit of Hughes Electronics Corp, said Thursday it entered into a $13.1 million agreement with the U.S. Air Force to modernize and upgrade operations of the U.S. Air Force Combat Climatology Center.</p>
<p>The three phase, 2-1/2 year modernization program calls for replacement of the aging mainframe computers at Scott Air Force Base and the Asheville, N.C. operations.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
